The diagram shows a running track $ABCDEF$. $AB$ and $ED$ are the straight sides. The ends $AFE$ and $BCD$ are semicircular shapes. $|AB| = |ED| = 90$ m and $|AE| = |BD| = 70$ m. Find

(a) the total length of the two semicircular ends, $AFE$ and $BCD$;

(b) the perimeter of the running track $ABCDEFA$;

(c) the total area of the running track $ABCDEFA$. $\left[\text{Take } \pi = \dfrac{22}{7}\right]$
